      "claim": "The query is an atovaquone-like 2-hydroxy-3-(4-(4-chlorophenyl)cyclohexyl)naphthalene-1,4-dione; the closest supplied analog is buparvaquone, which shares the 2-hydroxy-1,4-naphthoquinone core with a 4-substituted cyclohexyl group.",
      "card_ids": ["C157"]
