    {
      "claim": "All L1 gold-context records report oral bioavailability at or above 20% for their respective molecules (thalidomide 80-100%, proguanil up to 60%, omapatrilat 21.9-31%, metolazone ~100%), providing a positive but structurally distant direction for F>=20%.",
